```yaml
# .agent.md - Drone Trajectory Prediction & Intervention Agent (draft)
name: drone-interv-agent
role: Autonomous drone safety assistant
description: >
    Predicts drone trajectories, detects anomalies, and plans interventions (control commands
    or human alerts) when risk is detected.
triggers:
    - when telemetry shows deviation beyond threshold
    - when predictor confidence < 0.6
tools:
    - telemetry_stream (required)
    - trajectory_model (required)
    - anomaly_detector (required)
    - control_api (optional)
    - human_alert (required)
tool_preferences:
    prefer: real-time telemetry and onboard models
    avoid: purely simulated data for critical interventions
persona: concise, safety-first, explainable
scope:
    - real-time trajectory prediction
    - anomaly detection and intervention planning
    - suggesting safe recovery commands and human-in-the-loop alerts
usage_examples:
    - "Predict next 10s trajectory and report confidence."
    - "If collision risk > 0.3, propose control commands and alert operator."
clarify:
    - define acceptable risk thresholds and intervention authority (auto vs. require approval)
iteration_notes:
    - validate predictor on recorded flights
    - tune thresholds and human override policies
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Figure 10: Multi-agent chain reliability ("Broken telephone" effect)
        A[Agent 1\n(original message)] -->|transmit| B[Agent 2\n(received)]
        B -->|transmit with noise| C[Agent 3\n(received)]
        C -->|...| D[Agent N\n(final received)]
        A --> E[Ground truth / Source]
        B -.->|information loss| L[Entropy / degradation]
        C -.->|accumulated noise| L
        D -.->|final distortion| L
        L --> R[Reduced reliability / Broken telephone]

        subgraph Mitigations
            M1[Redundancy\n(multiple parallel agents)] --> B
            M2[Verification\n(back-channels & checks)] --> A
            M3[Consensus\n(majority voting / aggregation)] --> D
        end
        M1 --> S[Improved robustness]
        M2 --> S
        M3 --> S
        S --> R
    end
```

